public function init() {

    $load_gateways = array(
        'WC_Gateway_BACS',
        'WC_Gateway_Cheque',
        'WC_Gateway_COD',
    );

    foreach ( $load_gateways as $gateway ) {

        if ( is_string( $gateway ) && class_exists( $gateway ) ) {

            $gateway = new $gateway();
        }

        $this->payment_gateways[] = $gateway;
    }
}
What it does

Loads all payment gateways.

